# Market set (NW_CITY_MERCHANT) before/after, stage 2: one frame per visual, census, FPS over the market.
# Run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT= (originals) and with the set root; OPENGOTHIC_CENSUS=<absolute out>/census.json.
# Positions are copies of each visual in the district (scripts/content-meshes.sh areas); the hero is parked below the world.
# A shot is written at the end of its frame: wait after it before the camera moves on.
